Total Changes: 34

[IMP] maintenance: allow multiple assignees and improve kanban card UX

The maintenance request form and kanban cards were limited to a single
technician. This commit converts the technician field to a Many2many
to allow multiple assignees per request and improves the overall
kanban usability.

This commit's changes:
* Convert 'user_id' (Many2one) to 'user_ids' (Many2many) to support
  multiple technicians per maintenance request.
* Update the kanban card to show 'user_ids' using the Many2many avatar
  widget, allowing users to manage assignees directly from the card.
* Swap the positions of the status icon and the user avatars on kanban
  cards to match standard Odoo layouts.
* Update the form, list, calendar, and activity views to support the
  new 'user_ids' field.
* Refactor follower logic to ensure only new assignees are added as
  followers. This prevents users who manually unsubscribed from being
  automatically re-subscribed during subsequent updates.

